 /2026/07/Keith-Karnaky-Jazz-Group-at-Archway-Gallery.jpg
UID:SkkbvuS-b2Hmyvh-M-7KQ
SUMMARY:Keith Karnaky Jazz Group at Archway Gallery
DTSTAMP:20260806T110908Z
DTSTART:20260809T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Now celebrating its fiftieth year\, the member-owned Montrose g
	allery audience presents an evening of timeless jazz by audience favorite 
	Keith Karnaky—joined by an ensemble of top improvisational musicians. \nTh
	e program will feature timeless jazz standards and improvisations in one o
	f Houston’s most intimate listening spaces. \nKarnaky will be joined by ac
	claimed saxophonist Woody Witt—an internationally recognized performer\, c
	omposer\, and educator\, with a career spanning jazz and classical music. 
	\nOpened in 1976\, Archway Gallery is currently celebrating its fiftieth y
	ear. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more. \nAcclaimed Saxophonist Woody Witt joi
	ns Keith Karnaky for a night of live timeless jazz songs at Archway Galler
	y. | Photo courtesy of Archway Gallery \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing
	 was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with ima
	ges and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organizati
	on\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsi
